{"entries":[{"id":"songhan-2609.35110","sourceId":"songhan","sourceName":"韩松","title":"Sol-H3: Recursive Self-Improvement for MiniMax-H3 Inference Acceleration on Sol-Engine across Cloud and Edge","titleZh":"Sol-H3：面向 MiniMax-H3 在 Sol-Engine 上跨云边推理加速的递归自我改进","published":"2026-09-28T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1790553600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/songhan-2609.35110/","image":"","summary":"Sol-H3 achieves up to 30x end-to-end speedup and 20% lower memory for MiniMax-H3 video diffusion inference across cloud and edge via a cross-resolution two-stage scheduler and recursive self-improvement kernel optimization.","summaryZh":"Sol-H3 通过跨分辨率两阶段调度器和递归自我改进内核优化，在云边部署中为 MiniMax-H3 视频扩散推理实现高达 30 倍的端到端加速和 20%的内存降低。"},{"id":"songhan-2607.28449","sourceId":"songhan","sourceName":"韩松","title":"Lightning OPD 2.0: Mitigating Style Bias in Cross-Teacher On-Policy Distillation for Large Reasoning Models","titleZh":"Lightning OPD 2.0：缓解大型推理模型跨教师在线策略蒸馏中的风格偏差","published":"2026-07-30T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1785369600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/songhan-2607.28449/","image":"","summary":"Lightning OPD 2.0 removes style-token bias via cross-fitted style residualization, enabling effective on-policy distillation even when the SFT and distillation teachers differ.","summaryZh":"Lightning OPD 2.0 通过交叉拟合风格残差化消除风格标记偏差，使得在 SFT 教师与蒸馏教师不同时仍能高效进行在线策略蒸馏。"},{"id":"songhan-2606.04511","sourceId":"songhan","sourceName":"韩松 · MIT / NVIDIA","title":"SparDA: Sparse Decoupled Attention for Efficient Long-Context LLM Inference","titleZh":"SparDA：用于高效长上下文 LLM 推理的稀疏解耦注意力","published":"2026-06-03T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1780444800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/songhan-2606.04511/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/146350423d4c3117.webp","summary":"SparDA introduces a decoupled sparse attention architecture with a Forecast projection to overlap KV cache prefetching with computation, achieving up to 1.7× decode speedup and 5.3× higher throughput.","summaryZh":"SparDA 提出了一种解耦的稀疏注意力架构，通过引入预测投影（Forecast）将 KV 缓存预取与计算重叠，实现了高达 1.7 倍的解码加速和 5.3 倍的吞吐量提升。"},{"id":"songhan-2412.04468","sourceId":"songhan","sourceName":"韩松 · NVIDIA / MIT","title":"NVILA: Efficient Frontier Visual Language Models","titleZh":"NVILA：高效前沿视觉语言模型","published":"2024-12-05T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1733356800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/songhan-2412.04468/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/4954f4118acf5e19.webp","summary":"NVILA achieves state-of-the-art accuracy with significantly reduced training cost and latency.","summaryZh":"NVILA 在保持顶尖精度的同时，大幅降低了训练成本和延迟。"},{"id":"songhan-2411.05007","sourceId":"songhan","sourceName":"韩松 · MIT","title":"SVDQuant: Absorbing Outliers by Low-Rank Components for 4-Bit Diffusion Models","titleZh":"SVDQuant：通过低秩组件吸收异常值实现 4 比特扩散模型","published":"2024-11-07T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1730937600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/songhan-2411.05007/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/7b2585fccd93e98e.webp","summary":"SVDQuant absorbs outliers via a low-rank branch, enabling 4-bit quantization for diffusion models with significant speedup and memory reduction.","summaryZh":"SVDQuant 通过低秩分支吸收异常值，实现扩散模型的 4 比特量化，显著提升速度并降低内存。"},{"id":"songhan-2410.10733","sourceId":"songhan","sourceName":"韩松 · MIT","title":"Deep Compression Autoencoder for Efficient High-Resolution Diffusion Models","titleZh":"深度压缩自编码器：面向高效高分辨率扩散模型","published":"2024-10-14T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1728864000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/songhan-2410.10733/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/2dd5cdd9e701c3c0.webp","summary":"DC-AE achieves up to 128x spatial compression for diffusion models, enabling 19x speedup on ImageNet 512x512 without quality loss.","summaryZh":"DC-AE 实现高达 128 倍空间压缩，在 ImageNet 512x512 上带来 19 倍加速且不损失质量。"},{"id":"songhan-2405.04532","sourceId":"songhan","sourceName":"韩松 · MIT","title":"QServe: W4A8KV4 Quantization and System Co-design for Efficient LLM Serving","titleZh":"QServe: W4A8KV4 量化与系统协同设计实现高效 LLM 服务","published":"2024-05-07T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1715040000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/songhan-2405.04532/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/ae45291a8265d6c7.webp","summary":"QServe achieves up to 3.5x throughput improvement and 3x cost reduction for LLM serving via W4A8KV4 quantization and system co-design.","summaryZh":"QServe 通过 W4A8KV4 量化与系统协同设计，实现 LLM 服务吞吐量提升最高 3.5 倍，成本降低 3 倍。"},{"id":"songhan-2309.17453","sourceId":"songhan","sourceName":"韩松 · MIT","title":"Efficient Streaming Language Models with Attention Sinks","titleZh":"高效流式语言模型：注意力汇聚机制","published":"2023-09-29T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1695945600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/songhan-2309.17453/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/fc5f9de0edb32008.webp","summary":"StreamingLLM enables LLMs to handle infinite-length sequences by leveraging attention sinks from initial tokens.","summaryZh":"StreamingLLM 通过利用初始令牌的注意力汇聚机制，使大语言模型能够处理无限长度的序列。"},{"id":"songhan-2306.00978","sourceId":"songhan","sourceName":"韩松 · MIT","title":"AWQ: Activation-aware Weight Quantization for LLM Compression and Acceleration","titleZh":"AWQ：面向大语言模型压缩与加速的激活感知权重量化","published":"2023-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1685577600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/songhan-2306.00978/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/50f7fe604e3504db.webp","summary":"AWQ protects only 1% salient weights by scaling up their channels based on activation distribution, achieving hardware-friendly low-bit quantization without backpropagation.","summaryZh":"AWQ 通过基于激活分布缩放显著权重通道，仅保护 1%的权重即可大幅降低量化误差，实现无需反向传播的硬件友好型低位量化。"},{"id":"songhan-2211.10438","sourceId":"songhan","sourceName":"韩松 · MIT","title":"SmoothQuant: Accurate and Efficient Post-Training Quantization for Large Language Models","titleZh":"SmoothQuant：大型语言模型的准确高效训练后量化","published":"2022-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1668729600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/songhan-2211.10438/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/c2136f103e658ec2.webp","summary":"SmoothQuant enables accurate and efficient 8-bit weight and activation quantization for LLMs without training.","summaryZh":"SmoothQuant 实现了大型语言模型无需训练的 8 位权重和激活量化，准确且高效。"},{"id":"songhan-2205.14756","sourceId":"songhan","sourceName":"韩松 · MIT","title":"EfficientViT: Multi-Scale Linear Attention for High-Resolution Dense Prediction","titleZh":"EfficientViT：用于高分辨率密集预测的多尺度线性注意力","published":"2022-05-29T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1653782400000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/songhan-2205.14756/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/253bfba2e27fa0c1.webp","summary":"EfficientViT achieves global receptive field and multi-scale learning with lightweight, hardware-efficient operations, outperforming prior models in speed and accuracy on high-resolution dense prediction tasks.","summaryZh":"EfficientViT 通过轻量且硬件高效的操作实现全局感受野和多尺度学习，在高分辨率密集预测任务中，其速度和精度均超越先前模型。"},{"id":"songhan-1908.09791","sourceId":"songhan","sourceName":"韩松 · MIT","title":"Once-for-All: Train One Network and Specialize it for Efficient Deployment","titleZh":"一次训练，处处可用：训练一个网络，专用于高效部署","published":"2019-08-26T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1566777600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/songhan-1908.09791/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/3cb8200270e0a27b.webp","summary":"Train one network that supports diverse architectural settings and quickly specialize sub-networks for different devices without retraining.","summaryZh":"训练一个支持多种架构设置的网络，无需重新训练即可快速为不同设备定制子网络。"},{"id":"songhan-1510.00149","sourceId":"songhan","sourceName":"韩松 · Stanford","title":"Deep Compression: Compressing Deep Neural Networks with Pruning, Trained Quantization and Huffman Coding","titleZh":"深度压缩：通过剪枝、训练量化和霍夫曼编码压缩深度神经网络","published":"2015-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1443657600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/songhan-1510.00149/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/b00be33a26546e64.webp","summary":"Deep compression reduces neural network storage by 35x-49x without accuracy loss via pruning, quantization, and Huffman coding.","summaryZh":"深度压缩通过剪枝、量化和霍夫曼编码，在不损失精度的情况下将神经网络存储减少 35 倍至 49 倍。"}]}